# Open upstream fix to watch-pr, carried until cursor/plugins merges it: #769. --status-only
# reports a head with no checks as ci-none in one table and stops on the first query error,
# instead of retrying through the backoff schedule. The hunks are the PR's own code and test,
# rebased onto the post-rules tree unchanged.
#
# #769 and the still-open #592 both add a field after `allowDraft` in policy.ts, in readSnapshot's
# arguments and in runSimple's call to it, so if upstream lands #592 first this patch stops
# applying at those two lines and needs them re-resolved.
#
